---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import {business} from '../data/business';
---
<Layout title="Terms & Conditions — Draft for Business Review" description="Draft website terms for Ekramul All Repairing Service Center. Service scope, inspection, cost, parts and timing must be confirmed directly with the business." noindex>
<PageHero crumb="Terms & Conditions" title="Terms &amp; conditions" eyebrow="WEBSITE INFORMATION" description="Draft website terms for business review. Any service-specific arrangements must be discussed directly with the service center."/>
<section class="section"><article class="wrap legal prose"><span class="draft-badge">Draft for business review</span><h2>About this website</h2><p>This website presents the repair and maintenance enquiry categories of {business.name}. Equipment photographs illustrate service categories unless identified as client-supplied repair media. Generated service images do not represent actual employees or completed projects.</p><h2>Enquiries and service arrangements</h2><p>Submitting an enquiry does not confirm an appointment, a repair, equipment compatibility or a price. The exact equipment, reported issue and any inspection arrangements must be discussed with the service center.</p><h2>Scope and equipment identification</h2><p>The service categories include broad equipment descriptions. “Coil-free compressor,” “high compressor washing motor” and “two-stand lift” require model-specific clarification. No technical specification, load rating or manufacturer authorization is implied by these names or images.</p><h2>Cost, parts and timing</h2><p>Work scope, repair feasibility, price, parts, timing and any service terms must be confirmed directly with the business before work is agreed. The website does not publish fixed prices, warranties, turnaround guarantees or cancellation terms.</p><h2>Third-party services</h2><p>The form uses FormSubmit, and map links open Google Maps. Those services have their own terms and privacy practices. The availability of an external service is outside this static website’s control.</p><h2>Details awaiting business review</h2><p>The business must review this draft and supply any applicable operational terms, warranty information, dispute procedures and legally required disclosures before these are published as final terms. Nothing here establishes an unconfirmed service policy.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For questions about the website or a repair enquiry, email <a class="text-link" href={`mailto:${business.email}`}>{business.email}</a> or call <a class="text-link" href={`tel:${business.phone}`}>{business.phoneDisplay}</a>.</p></article></section>
</Layout>
